00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:53.520
when you got hit, you just lost the most recent piece you acquired?

00:20:53.520 --> 00:21:00.320
So say you had three of the ship parts, including your base ship, so four parts technically.

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:06.160
If you just lost the most recent one, or maybe the most powerful one of those determined by

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:11.900
the numbers on them, if you just lost that piece, and now you could technically take, like,

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:15.580
because you had three, you could technically take four hits before you died.

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.240
Is that just a great quality of life improvement?

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:21.120
