00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:35.600
So it might all be for naught if it worked that way.

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:38.540
That's not entirely accurate.

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:41.780
But I don't think it would break the game.

00:21:42.100 --> 00:21:48.100
