00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:07.660
was, you know, that was all you had left.

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:12.220
And now you're dead. I hate finding out that I only can have like one or two hits because it is a, you know,

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:15.160
it's a demanding thing to always be on top of these bullets and everything.

