00:22:56.400 --> 00:23:02.760
there, but I certainly feel like it was probably more appreciated back then than it is now when

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:09.780
games today are so focused on, you know, beating them and figuring out like the, not the story,

00:23:09.940 --> 00:23:12.040
but like seeing it through to the end.

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:17.020
Whereas in, you know, games back then it was just more about score and how far you get.

00:23:17.180 --> 00:23:24.820
Like maybe a shmup isn't about beating it and more about that cool moment of like, this time I got

00:23:24.820 --> 00:23:26.380
